error[keywords]: `uint16` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:2:27
   │
 2 │ typedef map<string, long> uint16;  // 'uint16' is a keyword
   ·                           ^^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_uint16`
